Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

- Complete Simplified Chinese localization of the app string catalog
  (Thaw/Resources/Localizable.xcstrings), plus the review toolchain under
  scripts/localization and l10n/zh-Hans.
- Simplified Chinese README and fork documentation.
- Sparkle automatic updates disabled; repository and changelog links point at
  this fork.
- Dual-display menu bar improvements for macOS 27.

